<title>UK: AHB sets 1.0 billion mark bond due 2005.</title>
<headline>AHB sets 1.0 billion mark bond due 2005.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Commerzbank, DG Bank, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Trinkaus and Burkhardt.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ALLGEMEINE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.25	MATURITY    25.FEB.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.36     PAY DATE    25.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  31	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA2/=     DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    8	   SELL CONC  23	  PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
